; Journal.query() with --group-by returns the postings of every group, in
; group order, and runs each group through a report chain of its own, as
; `reg --group-by` does: -M subtotals Electric Company's February
; utilities apart from the Grocer's, and a compound subtotal keeps its
; display amount.  It used to return no postings at all, and with
; --group-by-cumulative it aborted.

2012/01/15 Electric Company
    Expenses:Utilities          $50.00
    Assets:Checking

2012/02/03 Grocer
    Expenses:Food               $20.00
    Expenses:Utilities           $5.00
    Assets:Checking

2012/02/15 Electric Company
    Expenses:Utilities          $55.00
    Assets:Checking

2012/02/20 Electric Company
    Expenses:Utilities          10 EUR
    Assets:Checking

test python test/regress/py-query-group-by.py
--group-by payee Expenses: 5 posts, 5 amounts
  2012-01-15 Expenses:Utilities $50.00
  2012-02-15 Expenses:Utilities $55.00
  2012-02-20 Expenses:Utilities 10 EUR
  2012-02-03 Expenses:Food $20.00
  2012-02-03 Expenses:Utilities $5.00
--group-by payee -M Expenses: 4 posts, 4 amounts
  2012-01-01 Expenses:Utilities $50.00
  2012-02-01 Expenses:Utilities $55.00 + 10 EUR
  2012-02-01 Expenses:Food $20.00
  2012-02-01 Expenses:Utilities $5.00
--group-by payee Income: 0 posts, 0 amounts
--group-by payee --account "'X'" Expenses: 5 posts, 5 amounts
  2012-01-15 X:Expenses:Utilities $50.00
  2012-02-15 X:Expenses:Utilities $55.00
  2012-02-20 X:Expenses:Utilities 10 EUR
  2012-02-03 X:Expenses:Food $20.00
  2012-02-03 X:Expenses:Utilities $5.00
--group-by payee --group-by-cumulative Expenses: 5 posts, 5 amounts
  2012-01-15 Expenses:Utilities $50.00
  2012-02-15 Expenses:Utilities $55.00
  2012-02-20 Expenses:Utilities 10 EUR
  2012-02-03 Expenses:Food $20.00
  2012-02-03 Expenses:Utilities $5.00
Expenses: 5 posts, 5 amounts
  2012-01-15 Expenses:Utilities $50.00
  2012-02-03 Expenses:Food $20.00
  2012-02-03 Expenses:Utilities $5.00
  2012-02-15 Expenses:Utilities $55.00
  2012-02-20 Expenses:Utilities 10 EUR
-M Expenses: 3 posts, 3 amounts
  2012-01-01 Expenses:Utilities $50.00
  2012-02-01 Expenses:Food $20.00
  2012-02-01 Expenses:Utilities $60.00 + 10 EUR
held: 4 posts: Expenses:Utilities $50.00, Expenses:Utilities $55.00 + 10 EUR, Expenses:Food $20.00, Expenses:Utilities $5.00
